<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64440" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾰγ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάσσω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>any kneaded mass,
			cake</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jd.</u>
				7.13
			</span></i>; <i>lump</i> of fat, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.76
			</span></i>; esp. <i>cake</i> offered to Hecate and Trophonius, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				734
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				813
			</span></i>; <i><span class="en">
				Cypr.
			</span></i> acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				14.663b
			</span></i>; described as a small <i>cheese-pudding</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.133
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Steril.</u>
				235
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>kneading-trough</i> or <i>dresser</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				40.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii/iii A. D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				10.81
			</span></i>; <i>small table</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				118
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cerc.
				12
			</span></i>; also, <i>round pan</i> or <i>plate</i> for placing on
			the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίπους</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.83
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαγίδες: αἷς ἀπομάττουσι καὶ
			καθαίρουσι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
